    Settled: the walk (2c) and its skip; the pass marks and prints. testOP runs a marked chain as an unmarked one.
    Not built: nothing reads the marks yet. Step 3b is native arithmetic from them, values staying in the fields.
    `=` is not marked (it carries no per-kind attribute); the pass uses it only to learn a local's kind.
